1
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:07,420
Frame!

2
00:00:10,519 --> 00:00:13,177
This is Frame —
Apirut Putkajorn.

3
00:00:13,801 --> 00:00:16,206
My chaotic friend who
stresses me out constantly.

4
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:18,520
Horny, reckless, a total menace.

5
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:20,175
He's broken
countless girls' hearts.

6
00:00:20,399 --> 00:00:22,073
If he has any good
traits at all, it's that—

7
00:00:22,073 --> 00:00:23,099
Why are you running?

8
00:00:23,099 --> 00:00:27,417
I came to drag you to class!
You're already five minutes late.

9
00:00:27,417 --> 00:00:31,675
Can't. I'm meeting a gorgeous senior
under the science building.

10
00:00:31,675 --> 00:00:33,214
You go up first.
I'll catch up.

11
00:00:33,628 --> 00:00:36,375
Your "important business" is
hooking up with a girl?

12
00:00:36,822 --> 00:00:37,322
Yep.

13
00:00:37,521 --> 00:00:39,013
And that's more important than class?

14
00:00:39,013 --> 00:00:41,320
Can't you just wait until after school?

15
00:00:42,911 --> 00:00:44,187
Have you ever tried it?

16
00:00:44,611 --> 00:00:46,286
If you had, you'd know it

17
00:00:46,310 --> 00:00:49,685
feels way better than
sitting bored in class, man.

18
00:00:50,431 --> 00:00:52,002
Or… you've never done it?

19
00:00:52,566 --> 00:00:53,721
Hey— wait.

20
00:00:56,719 --> 00:00:58,888
Whether I have or haven't,
that's my business.

21
00:00:59,783 --> 00:01:01,048
So that means you haven't.

22
00:01:04,839 --> 00:01:06,476
You're such a nerd, Book.

23
00:01:06,874 --> 00:01:08,035
Want me to teach you?

24
00:01:08,035 --> 00:01:10,559
Want me to give you lessons?

25
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,553
This is the kind of thing I'm good at.

26
00:01:16,439 --> 00:01:17,650
No. Absolutely not.

27
00:01:19,258 --> 00:01:22,555
And stop changing the subject.
Get to class. Now.

28
00:01:23,334 --> 00:01:26,076
I can't, dude. I already made plans.

29
00:01:26,076 --> 00:01:27,223
Just go up first.

30
00:01:31,320 --> 00:01:34,067
Come on.
Get to class.

31
00:01:34,067 --> 00:01:36,000
I told you—
I already made plans.

32
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,903
Aren't you tired holding that?

33
00:01:42,903 --> 00:01:44,569
I said put it down.

34
00:01:44,569 --> 00:01:45,815
Frame!
